* CABSRT01 - PRESORT BY OCN/BAN/SEQ BEFORE DUPLICATE CHECKING
* MVT SORT/MERGE CONTROL CARD.  USED WHEN CABING03 (DEDUP) IS
* RERUN STANDALONE - THE HEADER ON CABING03 REQUIRES THE INPUT
* BE PRESENTED IN OCN/BAN/SEQ ORDER ON EVERY RERUN, AND THE
* DEDUP LOGIC COMPARES ADJACENT RECORDS ONLY.
*
* THE RECORD SELECTION HAS LEFT THIS CARD.  RECORD TYPES 01
* THROUGH 08, AND THE APPROVED SOURCE SYSTEM LIST AT COLUMNS 45
* AND 46 (03 EMI GATEWAY, 05 CRIS FEED, 07 MEDIATION), ARE BOTH
* HELD IN THE E15 EXIT CABSXSRC.  ONBOARDING A SOURCE SYSTEM IS
* A RECOMPILE AND A RELINK OF THAT MODULE.  RECORDS OUTSIDE THE
* LIST ARE DELETED WITH NO SUSPENSE ENTRY AND NO ERROR.
*
* EQUAL KEY HANDLING IS NOT CODED.  THE KEY CARRIES THE SEQUENCE
* NUMBER, SO NO TWO RECORDS PRESENT AN EQUAL KEY AND THERE IS NO
* EQUAL KEY ORDER FOR ANY EXIT TO GUARANTEE.
*
* THE SELECTION RULE IS NO LONGER READABLE FROM THIS CARD.
 SORT FIELDS=(5,4,CH,A,9,13,CH,A,22,9,CH,A)
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=(200)
 MODS E15=(CABSXSRC,4096,SORTEXIT,N)
 END
